WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.501 --> 00:00:03.084
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.515 --> 00:00:10.682
- I am from a very small town
in Texas called Newcastle.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.726
I love Texas, it's my home,

00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:18.710
but it's so limited as to what you can do,

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:22.210
so Clash is really a doorway to the world.

00:00:28.038 --> 00:00:30.970
I'm Jett Blackheart, I'm
the leader of Clash Babes.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:33.150
- [Interviewer] So what
are the Clash Babes?

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:36.030
- Clash Babes are an
organization of female players

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:39.896
of Clash of Clans, and we
come together where we setup

00:00:39.896 --> 00:00:41.896
a war with another clan.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:46.252
A lot of guys think that
they're going to go up

00:00:46.252 --> 00:00:48.217
against the Clash Babes and
it's gonna be an easy win.

00:00:48.217 --> 00:00:50.016
- Jett Blackheart's
going down, just saying.

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:51.416
- [Jett] But once the war gets started--

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.753
- We've got one blue remaining up there.

00:00:52.753 --> 00:00:54.637
Not good, come on, come
on, come on, come on.

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:55.795
That's not good.

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:59.555
- They realize we're just
as badass as everyone else.

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:01.335
It's not just about Clash,

00:01:01.335 --> 00:01:05.335
but it's the social aspect
and how global it is.

00:01:07.852 --> 00:01:11.395
- I'm Emyoe, I live in Khartoum, Sudan.

00:01:11.395 --> 00:01:14.746
I feel comfortable with my Clash Babes.

00:01:14.746 --> 00:01:16.493
We come together as a team.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.851
- Wizard towers and
X-bows, I do those last.

00:01:18.851 --> 00:01:20.254
- We help each other.

00:01:20.254 --> 00:01:22.145
Killing me, by the way.

00:01:22.145 --> 00:01:23.478
- We're ready for the Babes war.

00:01:23.478 --> 00:01:24.659
- They like me who I am.

00:01:24.659 --> 00:01:25.690
- I'll talk to you after while.

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:27.918
I am so proud of the Clash Babes.

00:01:27.918 --> 00:01:29.267
We have come so far.

00:01:29.267 --> 00:01:32.008
It is a constantly ever-changing,

00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:34.508
evolving mix of awesome women.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.007
We've got Clash Babes from all
over, pretty much every state

00:01:38.007 --> 00:01:39.454
in the United States.

00:01:39.454 --> 00:01:42.402
There's Egypt, the Sudan, India,

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:45.388
England, Scotland, Ireland, Sweden,

00:01:45.388 --> 00:01:48.750
Serbia, Indonesia, the Philippines.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.537
But there's a lot of
other women out there,

00:01:51.537 --> 00:01:55.454
'cause you can never have
too many Clash Babes.

